sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant H as CommandHistory (invoker)
  participant K as AppendCommand
  participant E as Editor (receiver)
  C->>K: new AppendCommand(editor, "Olá")
  C->>H: run(comando)
  H->>K: execute()
  K->>E: text += "Olá"
  H->>H: empilha no histórico
  C->>H: undo()
  H->>K: undo()
  K->>E: remove "Olá"
  C->>H: redo()
  H->>K: execute()
  K->>E: text += "Olá"
